#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:33 1c2117ab1e474adeacb3c5315464f0e6
msgid "Connecting the Receiver"
msgstr "连接接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:35 f57eb82de8c8414790b801dc3690cea0
msgid ""
"For all protocols above, ArduPilot auto-detects the protocol of the RC "
"receiver system. However, depending on the protocol and autopilot type, the "
"physical connection to the autopilot may differ."
msgstr ""
"对于上述所有协议，ArduPilot 均可自动检测 RC 接收机系统所使用的协议。但根据协议和飞控类型的不同，与飞控的物理连接方式可能有所不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:37 c1b16ce634304130852d5264aa553f82
msgid ""
"Some protocols, most notably SRXL2, CRSF, and ELRS, require a full UART "
"connection."
msgstr "部分协议（尤其是 SRXL2、CRSF 和 ELRS）需要完整的 UART 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:39 ea0e3badfa6a4c17a3ae6bfc6e31be94
msgid ""
"In addition other protocols that also provide telemetry, like FPort, would "
"generally require a bi-directional half-duplex connection in order to obtain"
" telemetry. For these protocols the TX output of the UART should be "
"connected to the serial input of the receiver. It is also possible on F7 and"
" H7 boards to connect to the UART RX input with some additional "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"此外，FPort 等同时提供数传功能的协议通常需要双向半双工连接才能获取数传数据。对于这些协议，UART 的 TX 输出应连接至接收机的串口输入。在 "
"F7 和 H7 板上，也可通过额外配置连接至 UART 的 RX 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:42 18672e4a31434b5a91efff6b822ba1b5
msgid "PPM-Sum/SBus/i-BUS"
msgstr "PPM-Sum / SBus / i-BUS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:44 171468e4bd0842cba6cc93f0593fe677
msgid ""
"These receivers are usually connected to the RCin or SBUS input pin on the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "这些接收机通常连接至飞控的 RCin 或 SBUS 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:46 143bbdd0113c4882bbc83d9191bc7576
msgid ""
"To connect a PPM-Sum receiver or an SBus receiver to a Pixhawk, for example,"
" plug the ground (black), power (red) and signal (usually white - orange in "
"the diagram below) wires to the RC pins on the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"例如，将 PPM-Sum 或 SBus 接收机连接至 Pixhawk 时，将地线（黑）、电源线（红）和信号线（通常为白色，下图中为橙色）插入 "
"Pixhawk 的 RC 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:53 731c7fcd87a24c8182c1cdff27b6935f
msgid ""
"The parameter to enable the SBus output from the PixHawk style autopilots is"
" :ref:`BRD_SBUS_OUT<BRD_SBUS_OUT>`. This is only to pass SBus externally to "
"other devices, like servos. Not to connect a receiver to RCin or SBus In."
msgstr ""
"在 PixHawk 风格飞控上启用 SBus 输出的参数为 :ref:`BRD_SBUS_OUT<BRD_SBUS_OUT>`。此功能仅用于将 SBus"
" 信号输出至外部设备（如舵机），而非将接收机连接至 RCin 或 SBus 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:58 74aae266f29846a48705862b333f6023
msgid "DSM/DSM2/DSM-X/SRXL/SUM-D"
msgstr "DSM / DSM2 / DSM-X / SRXL / SUM-D"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:60 19e985649f054d0abb68ff24d4534c72
msgid ""
"For autopilots that do not provide a separate ``DSM`` input, these can be "
"connected as above. However, for performance reasons on autopilots that use "
"an IOMCU (The Pixhawk/Cube family), the autopilot's ``DSM`` input connection"
" is highly recommended."
msgstr ""
"对于没有独立 ``DSM`` 输入的飞控，这些协议的接收机可按上述方式连接。但对于使用 IOMCU 的飞控（Pixhawk/Cube "
"系列），出于性能考虑，强烈建议使用飞控的专用 ``DSM`` 输入接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:66 96c207dda64a4a9ca14e4ca47136cd2f
msgid "FPort/FPort2"
msgstr "FPort / FPort2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:68 82f591fa503b4e6a80ba0fc45f308b21
msgid ""
"FPort is a bi-directional protocol, using SBus RC in one direction, and "
"serial telemetry in the other. The RC portion can be decoded when attached "
"to an autopilot as if it were SBus, but the embedded telemetry would be "
"lost. See the :ref:`FPort setup documentation<common-FPort-receivers>` for "
"details on connection to one of the autopilots Serial Ports."
msgstr ""
"FPort 是双向协议，一个方向传输 SBus RC 信号，另一个方向传输串口数传。将其连接至飞控时，RC 部分可像 SBus "
"一样解码，但嵌入的数传数据将丢失。有关连接至飞控串口的详情，请参阅 :ref:`FPort 设置文档<common-FPort-receivers>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:72 5f4c999537974d77ab789aefa388ae6c
msgid ":ref:`mLRS <common-mlrs-rc>`"
msgstr ":ref:`mLRS <common-mlrs-rc>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:74 405d430332eb49a1ba45541c9fc982a6
msgid ""
"mLRS can provide RC control and MAVLink telemetry. mLRS receivers have an RC"
" output pin that can be configured for either SBUS or CRSF protocol (CRSF "
"would be only RC data). For SBUS you can connect it to the autopilot's RCin "
"pin. For CRSF or SBUS, it can be connected to any autopilot UART RX pin and "
"that port configured for RC protocol. Using CRSF portocol, allows RSSI/LQ "
"information to be delivered to the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"mLRS 可提供 RC 控制和 MAVLink 数传。mLRS 接收机有一个 RC 输出引脚，可配置为 SBUS 或 CRSF 协议（CRSF 仅传输 "
"RC 数据）。使用 SBUS 时，可连接至飞控的 RCin 引脚。使用 CRSF 或 SBUS 时，也可连接至任意飞控 UART 的 RX "
"引脚，并将该接口配置为 RC 协议。使用 CRSF 协议还可将 RSSI/LQ 信息传递至飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:76 15c1449b09234e8b8ef7ecfd38bb489a
msgid ""
"For optional telemetry a separate TX/RX port is provided on the receiver to "
"be connected to an autopilot MAVLink telemetry serial port. You can omit the"
" single wire RC connection and configure the mLRS receiver to output RC "
"channels over MAVLink if you are not using GCS RC overrides (eg, joystick)"
msgstr ""
"如需使用可选数传，接收机上提供了独立的 TX/RX 接口，用于连接至飞控的 MAVLink 数传串口。若您不使用地面站 RC "
"覆盖（如摇杆），也可省略单线 RC 连接，配置 mLRS 接收机通过 MAVLink 输出 RC 通道数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:80 0a168662adc143acbd1869c9dbb137a8
msgid "SRXL2/CRSF/ELRS"
msgstr "SRXL2 / CRSF / ELRS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:82 2206f10d8c4a4ff1ba09c2fb162354f3
msgid ""
"These bi-directional protocols require the use of a Serial Port. See links "
"below for setup and connections."
msgstr "这些双向协议需要使用串口。连接和设置详情请参阅以下链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:85
#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:154
#: 030c6bb16cdb42edb7dcf5c97d1f6834 4485094959104ad58a342db86f08eef9
#: afbb7d757c164358a01af4b0077df153
msgid "IRC Ghost"
msgstr "IRC Ghost"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:87 0b0fdb64285b440b8107c653d82d89e1
msgid ""
"This requires a connection to a full UART port via its TX pin. The port "
"should be set for half-duplex RC input:"
msgstr "需通过 TX 引脚连接至完整 UART 接口。该接口应设置为半双工 RC 输入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:89 16e8c1cc98544aac88a77a88f4555a4e
msgid "using SERIAL2 as the port:"
msgstr "以 SERIAL2 为例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:91 33b0c29569494ba7a0fe1c7f8669d830
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 23 (RCinput)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 23（RC 输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:92 966c2dda827748788d980fc5178ec3b2
