msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 4（半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:93 fae906ef91b948289b4c580e1d8760e7
msgid ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:96 a7af30f18fa44004b4c9f7883f414461
msgid "RC input to Serial Port"
msgstr "RC 输入至串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:98 b8a1444ceda4406495cbf2316efd1d57
msgid ""
"any UART RX input will auto-detect all the protocols (except PPM, or "
"SRXL2/CRSF/ELRS which also require connection of the UART's TX pin), if the "
"serial port protocol is set to 23 (for example, generally, "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` for the TELEM2 UART if used). The "
"exception to this is for SBUS attached to UARTs on F4 based autopilots. This"
" requires an external inverter since SBUS is inverted and F4 autopilots do "
"not have selectable inversion on their UART pins."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 的 RX 输入均可自动检测所有协议（PPM 和 SRXL2/CRSF/ELRS 除外，这些协议还需连接 UART 的 TX "
"引脚），前提是串口协议设置为 23（例如通常将 TELEM2 UART 的 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设为 23）。例外情况是在基于 F4 的飞控上通过 UART 连接 "
"SBUS，由于 SBUS 信号是反相的，而 F4 飞控的 UART 引脚不支持可选反相，因此需要外部反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:100
#: d7a5c1e7d7d54e348f2a4048cc768b8e
msgid ""
"The serial port baudrate is automatically set and controlled by the firmware"
" when any serial RC protocol is detected."
msgstr "当检测到任何串口 RC 协议时，固件将自动设置和管理串口波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:104
#: 43269d2be2964de29db3d1a0d8977939
msgid "Radio System Selection"
msgstr "遥控系统选型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:106
#: fc103408fa7c498f916380dc17087155
msgid ""
"Selection will depend on many factors: range,telemetry requirements, cost, "
"compatibility with existing equipment, etc. Most manufacturers often many "
"different models with differing capabilities. Many systems have been "
"reverse-engineered and \"cloned\" by other manufacturers offering more "
"economical versions of transmitters and receivers. Many Transmitters offer "
"multiple protocols and are based on the `OpenTX <https://www.open-"
"tx.org/>`__ firmware which is extremely flexible and also allows the use of "
"LUA scripts to display telemetry data on their LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"选型取决于多种因素：距离、数传需求、成本、与现有设备的兼容性等。大多数厂商提供多款具有不同功能的产品。许多系统已被逆向工程并被其他厂商「克隆」，提供更经济实惠的发射机和接收机版本。许多发射机支持多种协议，并基于"
" `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ 固件，该固件极为灵活，还支持在 LCD 屏幕上运行 LUA "
"脚本显示数传数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:109
#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:134
#: 28445f7c3d684e8f90bd9f3f4fff319d a4c0ba36fe4043afbb6edfbf729fc126
msgid "Range"
msgstr "距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:111
#: a508e9c9e0bc446287d54923fd94f889
msgid ""
"RC control range varies greatly depending on system used, installation, "
"antennas used, terrain, and even weather conditions. But in general, for "
"discussion purposes here, RC systems can be categorized into Short Range "
"(2km and under) , Medium (2-10km) and Long Range (>10km). In addition, they "
"may offer uni-directional (Vehicle to Transmitter) or bi-directional "
"(Vehicle to/from Transmitter) telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RC 控制距离因所用系统、安装方式、天线、地形甚至天气条件的不同而差异很大。但总体而言，RC 系统可大致分为短距（2km "
"以内）、中距（2–10km）和长距（>10km）三类。此外，它们可提供单向（飞行器至发射机）或双向（飞行器与发射机之间）数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:114
#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:134
#: 10ac142206544fb698f72845e44fc11d e2e7cc9035ae4ef0ba0823d33b8f09dd
msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr "数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:116
#: 58b9e15a36954e6c9989c32b73139004
msgid "FrSky Horus Transmitter running Yaapu LUA script"
msgstr "运行 Yaapu LUA 脚本的 FrSky Horus 发射机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:120
#: 12ecce06f2534d109b110665a622ce2e
msgid ""
"Some systems provide transparent radio modems sending the telemetry from the"
" autopilot, and others have proprietary protocols. Those with proprietary "
"protocols often have means of displaying  telemetry data on the transmitter "
"display itself, like FRSky or `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ based "
"Transmitters."
msgstr ""
"部分系统提供透明无线电调制解调器来传输飞控数传，其他系统则使用专有协议。具有专有协议的系统通常可直接在发射机显示屏上显示数传数据，如 FRSky 或基于"
" `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ 的发射机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:122
#: 0cde466e2db24040bff0c50dfae17ca6
msgid ""
"Telemetry speeds vary from 56K to 1-2K baud depending on protocol and, in "
"some cases, distance. Often telemetry range will be less than radio control "
"range."
msgstr "数传速率因协议和（某些情况下）距离的不同而有所差异，从 56K 到 1–2K 波特不等。数传距离通常小于 RC 控制距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:124
#: 1102d545e9c64311a9053d42c6b1d270
msgid "Consult"
msgstr "参考"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:127
