#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:227
#: 91c137d5875f4224a1ad4a45d9c915c5
msgid ""
"In Europe, Multiplex and Graupner are well established systems and comply "
"with EU radiation recommendations (as do many other brands as an option)."
msgstr "在欧洲，Multiplex 和 Graupner 是成熟系统，符合欧盟辐射建议（许多其他品牌也提供符合该建议的选项）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:229
#: a5a83356ce784e45b1cd5cb76e4a6797
msgid "Flysky produces very low cost, low end systems."
msgstr "Flysky 提供非常低成本的入门级系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:231
#: 88a188d1a44541b6ad01309f0d05f76e
msgid ""
"FRSky and Spektrum enjoy the largest established bases with Spektrum "
"dominant in park flyer and entry level RC systems. FRSky has telemetry "
"capabilities and utilizes `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ which is "
"very flexible and is continually adding features in the firmware."
msgstr ""
"FRSky 和 Spektrum 拥有最大的用户基础，Spektrum 在公园飞行器和入门级 RC 系统中占主导地位。FRSky 具备数传功能，并采用 "
"`OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__，该固件非常灵活且持续增加新功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:233
#: 6c4a0429224544bd8a663e31061bef00
msgid ""
"The Jumper T16 and RadioMaster T16 are FRSky Horus-like OpenTX based "
"transmitter clones with multiple RC protocols built-in."
msgstr ""
"Jumper T16 和 RadioMaster T16 是内置多种 RC 协议的 FRSky Horus 风格 OpenTX 克隆发射机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:236
#: 3eaf291562634bc9869ad48470cfc035
msgid "PPM encoders"
msgstr "PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-systems.rst:238
#: 1ffec6a4147f4889bc0d5ffb39e015eb
msgid ""
"A `PPM Encoder <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ppm+encoder>`__ will allow you to"
" use any older style RC receiver that has only PWM outputs for each channel "
"instead of an SBUS or PPM output. See :ref:`common-ppm-encoders-new` for "
"more information. This protocol is not being included on many new autopilots"
" and is being slowly obsoleted."
msgstr ""
"`PPM 编码器 <https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ppm+encoder>`__ 可让您使用每个通道只有 PWM 输出（而非 "
